  message: "Fixed in PR #4283 (merged origin/dev=1e0eb6ee2e). Behavioral evidence (closure-evidence discipline): re-ran the filed repro on canonical dev via bakeoff iter-002 (deep-20260623-134237/cohort-001/iter-002). SwiftyJSON swift field 407->19. The filed repro ArrayTests.array (let array = [...] at ArrayTests.swift:29 inside func testSingleDimensionalArraysGetter) is GONE; all 9 previously-leaked method-locals (json/jsonL2/processor/debugDescription/...) are gone. The 19 remaining are genuine stored properties (JSON struct rawArray/rawDictionary/type/... + CodableModel struct fields + test-class fixtures testData/family). The two dropped Source/ entries (let object in init(data:), var merged in merged(with:)) confirmed method-locals. No cross-language regression: iter-002 emission matrix identical to iter-001 for the other 7 languages; 0 non-canonical stable_ids, 0 per-file collisions. Root-cause fix: swift field-eligibility now requires the property_declaration DIRECT parent to be a type-body node (class_body / enum_class_body), not merely _get_enclosing_type being truthy. Regression tests TestSwiftMethodLocalExclusion (method/init/closure-local) lock it; 19529 passed, 100% coverage."  # d343
